  "title": "Greek, Cyrillic, Georgian, Armenian, Polish, Turkish & Vietnamese",
  "metadata": {
    "author": "pdfnative-cli samples",
    "subject": "Seven alphabetic scripts and Latin extensions, each with its own bundled module (pdfnative 1.8.0) — demonstration content",
    "keywords": "greek, cyrillic, georgian, armenian, polish, turkish, vietnamese, multilingual"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Greek, Cyrillic, Georgian, Armenian, Polish, Turkish & Vietnamese",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Rendered with --font el --font ru --font ka --font hy --font pl --font tr --font vi --font latin --lang el,ru,ka,hy,pl,tr,vi,latin. pdfnative 1.8.0 rebuilt the Polish, Turkish and Vietnamese modules so that every letter a module advertises is one it can draw: the ogonek letters, the dotless and dotted i, and the stacked Vietnamese diacritics below all come from their own subset."
    },
